    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d774">

                <pb facs="0840" n="828" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg828"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">121.861/17a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-09-05T19:00:00-04:00">September 5,
                            1941—7 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3604. 1. It is our plan formally to call the United States mission to Moscow “The
                    President’s Special War Supply Mission to the Union <pb facs="0841" n="829"
                        xml:id="pg829"/> of Soviet Socialist Republics”.<anchor n="80"
                        xml:id="d774-f1"/> Please inform the Department of formal designation of
                    British mission.</p>
                <p>2. Mr. Harriman is being designated as the Special Representative of the
                    President and Chairman of the Special War Supply Mission to the Union of Soviet
                    Socialist Republics with Rank of Ambassador, and the four members listed in my
                    3542, September 2, midnight,<anchor n="81" xml:id="d774-f2"/> have been
                    designated as Members on the Special War Supply Mission to the Union of Soviet
                    Socialist Republics with the Rank of Minister.</p>
                <p>3. Please inform Department of official ranks of British mission.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
